{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114661","id":3150675494,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc67y34m","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114661","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114661.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114661.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114661","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114661/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114661/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114661/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/857c5916d88d49a76e9da3b8dd4e9af69655f16d","number":114661,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add `[JsonInclude]` and `[JsonIgnore]` attributes in C#","user":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","html_url":"https://github.com/Joy-less","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This pull request adds `[JsonInclude]` and `[JsonIgnore]` attributes to the serializable `struct` types Godot implements in C#, in order to assist serialization/deserialization with System.Text.Json.\r\n\r\nSerialization with System.Text.Json already works, but it often includes unwanted properties.\r\n\r\n## Example\r\n\r\n```cs\r\nGD.Print(JsonSerializer.Serialize(Colors.Red));\r\n```\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n```\r\n{\"R8\":255,\"G8\":0,\"B8\":0,\"A8\":255,\"H\":0,\"S\":1,\"V\":1,\"OkHslH\":0.08120528,\"OkHslS\":1,\"OkHslL\":0.56808466,\"Luminance\":0.2126}\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n```\r\n{\"R\":1,\"G\":0,\"B\":0,\"A\":1}\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Workarounds\r\n\r\n### Using Godot.Json\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, Godot.Json has two problems in comparison to System.Text.Json:\r\n- It doesn't support custom types, which is a problem when you want to serialize a C# type that contains Godot types\r\n- It's not generic / statically-typed, which means you have to manually convert `Variant` to your C# type\r\n\r\n### Using wrappers / anonymous types\r\n\r\nYou can use a custom wrapper like so:\r\n\r\n```cs\r\nGD.Print(JsonSerializer.Serialize(new { Colors.Red.R, Colors.Red.G, Colors.Red.B, Colors.Red.A}));\r\n```\r\n\r\nHowever, this adds a lot of complexity when you want to serialize a C# type that contains Godot types.\r\n\r\n### Using custom JsonConverterAttributes\r\n\r\nThese can be used flexibly in complex C# types, but they are very [complex](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/standard/serialization/system-text-json/converters-how-to) to write.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id